## Bookmaker Weaknesses (What PHOENIX Exploits)

### 1. Algorithmic Rigidity
Automated odds adjustments follow fixed formulas:
- Wicket falls → Drop 20% (regardless of context)
- 2 boundaries → Increase session line by 8-10 runs
- PHOENIX detects when the algorithm OVERSHOOTS

### 2. Emotional Public Creates Imbalance
Recreational bettors bet with emotion:
- Favorite team bias (India always hammered)
- Bookmaker moves odds to balance book
- Creates contrarian value on the other side

### 3. Overround Variation
Not all markets are equally efficient:
- Match Winner: Tight margins (3-5%), hard to exploit
- Live in-play: Wider margins (5-8%), more opportunities after events
- The RL agent should learn WHERE value exists

### 4. Speed vs Accuracy Trade-off
Bookmakers must update fast to prevent arbitrage:
- Fast updates → risk overshooting
- PHOENIX profits from the 5-15 second correction window

